    "AI + 母带处理，导出的就是它": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI + mastering — this is what gets exported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 修复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Restoration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 处理后才能切换到“AI 处理后”和“成品”。三路试听按响度对齐，比较的是音质而不是音量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Process first to unlock “Processed” and “Final”. All three are loudness-matched, so you compare quality, not volume."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RE-USE 去噪去混响，未做母带": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RE-USE noise and reverb removal, before mastering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“AI 处理后”只看 AI 修复的效果（还没调 EQ、压缩和响度）；“成品”在它之上叠加下方的母带处理，用来调参数，导出的就是成品。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Processed” is the AI restoration alone (no EQ, compression or loudness yet). “Final” adds the mastering below on top of it — use it to tune the settings; it is what gets exported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键处理并导出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Process & Export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留默认名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep Default Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止并保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop and save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先完成 AI 处理再导出，或用工具栏的“一键处理并导出”。导出后只保留原始录音和成品文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run AI processing before exporting, or use “Process & Export” in the toolbar. After export only the original recording and the final file are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除所选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Selected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始录音和导出到会话文件夹的成品都会被删除，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original recordings and any exports in their session folders will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去除噪声和房间混响，修复麦克风音色。处理完会自动切到“AI 处理后”试听。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes noise and room reverb and repairs the mic’s tone. When it finishes, the preview switches to “Processed”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对所选录音依次进行 AI 处理、母带处理并导出到导出文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run AI processing, mastering and export for each selected recording, into the export folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
