    "强降噪（Inworld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strong noise removal (Inworld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 AI 修复之前先把人声从强背景噪声（音乐、人声嘈杂、风扇）里分离出来；安静环境下不需要。首次使用会下载约 256 MB 的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separates the voice from heavy background noise (music, crowds, fans) before AI restoration; not needed in a quiet room. Downloads a 256 MB model on first use."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
